{"seq":17,"slug":"backend-internationalization","title":"后端国际化","stage":"DONE","category":"backend-engineering","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization","rating":{"composite":4.27,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":4,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 后端国际化\n\n后端国际化是让服务端系统在不修改核心业务逻辑的前提下，正确处理任意语言、区域和文化习惯的工程实践。它覆盖从数据存储（时区、货币、排序规则）到翻译管道（消息格式、动态内容）再到运维保障（测试、性能、双向文本）的完整链路。与前端 UI 国际化不同，后端国际化关注的是数据层正确性和服务端架构设计——确保一条数据从写入到输出的全生命周期都保持 locale 无关或 locale 感知的一致性。\n\n本 hub 与相邻主题的分工边界如下。前端可访问性与 UI 层面的 i18n 实现（组件文案切换、RTL 布局渲染）属于 accessibility-i18n 的范畴；字符编码的底层理论（码点演变史、UTF 变体对比、BOM 处理）属于 character-encoding-i18n；纯粹的日期时间库选型和 API 用法属于 date-time-handling。本 hub 聚焦于后端系统中国际化工程的架构决策、数据处理策略与运维实践。\n\n推荐学习路径：先从「基础篇」建立 i18n 架构思维和编码/协商机制，再进入「数据处理篇」理解时区、货币和排序的后端实现细节，然后通过「内容翻译篇」掌握翻译管道的系统设计，最后在「运维篇」学习测试自动化、双向文本和性能优化。\n\n前置知识：HTTP 协议基础、至少一门后端语言的实际开发经验、关系型数据库基本操作。了解 Unicode 基本概念（码点、编码形式）会有帮助但非必须——基础篇会覆盖后端需要的关键知识。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"i18n-architecture-patterns","title":"国际化架构模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/foundations/i18n-architecture-patterns"},{"seq":2,"slug":"unicode-encoding-normalization","title":"Unicode 编码与规范化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/foundations/unicode-encoding-normalization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"locale-detection-negotiation","title":"区域检测与内容协商","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/foundations/locale-detection-negotiation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-handling","title":"数据处理篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/data-handling","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"timezone-datetime-handling","title":"时区与日期时间处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/data-handling/timezone-datetime-handling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"currency-number-formatting","title":"货币与数字格式化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/data-handling/currency-number-formatting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"collation-sorting-search","title":"排序规则与搜索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/data-handling/collation-sorting-search"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"content-translation","title":"内容翻译篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/content-translation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"translation-management-systems","title":"翻译管理系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/content-translation/translation-management-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dynamic-content-localization","title":"动态内容本地化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/content-translation/dynamic-content-localization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pluralization-gender-grammar","title":"复数化与语法适配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/content-translation/pluralization-gender-grammar"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"运维篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"i18n-testing-automation","title":"国际化测试与自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/operations/i18n-testing-automation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rtl-bidirectional-support","title":"RTL 与双向文本支持","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/operations/rtl-bidirectional-support"},{"seq":3,"slug":"i18n-performance-caching","title":"国际化性能与缓存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/operations/i18n-performance-caching"}]}]}